We have recently released Gutenberg 2.0, the latest version of our open-source platform for research software engineering training materials and events.

The headline feature is Courses: curated learning pathways that any registered user can work through at their own pace, with the same progress tracking our instructor-led events have always had.

2.0 also brings a redesigned home page, smarter navigation through material, and simpler course and event authoring for instructors.

Links:

- [Browse the courses](https://train.rse.ox.ac.uk/courses)
- [What's new in 2.0](https://blog.oxrse.uk/gutenberg/whats-new/v2-0/)
- [Source on GitHub](https://github.com/OxfordRSE/gutenberg)

